  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "//exports": "Each entry resolves to TS source under Bun (zero-build dev + an embedding host) and to the built dist/ on Node/npm. The `bun` condition must stay first.",
